flowchart LR
  Product[Organizations and active users] --> Customers[Billing customers]
  Customers --> Hist[Subscription and item histories]
  CRM[CRM won contracts] --> Terms[Signed service terms and amendments]
  Hist --> Terms
  Terms --> Billing[Invoices and credit notes]
  Billing --> Earned[Earned and future unearned schedules]
  Billing --> Charges[Successful captures and refunds]
  Charges --> Processor[Processor balance and payout batches]
  Processor --> Bank[Actual bank receipts]
  Earned --> GL[Double-entry GL]
  Bank --> GL
  Payroll[Earned payroll and funding] --> GL
  Cloud[Cloud usage and source bills] --> AP[Vendor bills and payments]
  Ads[Own marketing spend and source bills] --> AP
  Vendors[Supplier contracts and prepaid services] --> AP
  AP --> GL
  Budget[Original approved budget] -. compare .-> GL
